1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,498
Dante: He's turning! Get him off the bus!

2
00:00:02,818 --> 00:00:07,703
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part six of ten: the briefcase.

3
00:00:08,023 --> 00:00:13,004
Priya: Wait. Sweating. Shaking. Confused.

4
00:00:13,124 --> 00:00:14,343
Marcus: That's the symptom list!

5
00:00:14,663 --> 00:00:15,525
Priya: Look-alikes.

6
00:00:18,263 --> 00:00:22,322
Priya: Insulin. He's diabetic. His blood
sugar crashed.

7
00:00:22,442 --> 00:00:24,193
Mr. Park: I told you... it's private.

8
00:00:24,513 --> 00:00:27,627
Priya: He needs fifteen grams of sugar.
Fast.

9
00:00:27,747 --> 00:00:28,731
Teddy: I have a gummy bear!

10
00:00:28,851 --> 00:00:29,910
Priya: That's two grams.

11
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:35,163
Rosa: Diner. Forty meters. Vending
machine. Two minutes.

12
00:00:35,483 --> 00:00:36,249
Dante: I'm in!

13
00:00:36,369 --> 00:00:37,923
Vic: Chat, we're going in!

14
00:00:38,043 --> 00:00:39,374
Marcus: Why am I always in?

15
00:00:39,694 --> 00:00:40,762
Vic: Chat, don't blink!

16
00:00:41,294 --> 00:00:42,604
Steve: Table for one.

17
00:00:42,724 --> 00:00:43,587
Marcus: Is that Steve?

18
00:00:43,707 --> 00:00:45,193
Dante: Steve gets everywhere.

19
00:00:45,513 --> 00:00:46,983
Dante: It takes cards only.

20
00:00:47,103 --> 00:00:48,564
Marcus: Then it takes fists.

21
00:00:48,884 --> 00:00:50,264
Dante: The can is stuck!

22
00:00:50,384 --> 00:00:51,304
Marcus: Hold the machine.

23
00:00:51,624 --> 00:00:53,115
Rosa: Go go go!

24
00:00:53,435 --> 00:00:54,310
Dante: That was easy!

25
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:55,462
Marcus: That was not easy.

26
00:00:55,782 --> 00:00:56,656
Mr. Park: Orange juice?

27
00:00:56,776 --> 00:00:57,386
Priya: Cola.

28
00:00:57,506 --> 00:00:58,372
Mr. Park: ...Acceptable.

29
00:00:58,692 --> 00:01:02,161
Mr. Park: I have type one diabetes. I
should have said. People get weird.

30
00:01:02,281 --> 00:01:03,980
Priya: In an apocalypse, say it.

31
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,162
Teddy: Rosa's sweating too.

32
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:06,579
Priya: Rosa?

33
00:01:06,699 --> 00:01:08,983
Rosa: It's the engine. Sit down.

34
00:01:09,303 --> 00:01:16,803
BUS-E: Part six of ten, The Last Bus. Next:
the drawbridge. Follow for part seven. Panic is loud.

